  "sangamTamil": "இல்லா விடத்தும் இயைந்த அளவினால்\nஉள்ள விடம்போல் பெரிதுவந்து - மெல்லக்\nகொடையொடு பட்ட குணனுடைய மாந்தர்க்கு\nஅடையாவாம் ஆண்டைக் கதவு",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "Unchilled by adversity the good do good : heaven's gate is open to them. Even in their adverse hour, up to the measure of their means, as in the prosperous times, with large rejoicing heart to give is their nature still. To such good men heaven's gate is never closed.",
